  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 203.20 Concluding Proceeding. No party shall be required to rest his case at a given time, except when a hearings examiner has heard all relevant evidence and rebuttals.\n\nSource. #6337, eff 9-25-96 (from Saf-C 202.21); amd by #7349, eff 8-22-00; amd by #8174, INTERIM, eff 9-25-04, EXPIRES: 3-24-05; ss by #8230-A, eff 12-17-04 (formerly Saf-C 203.19)",
